# Custos Cursor entrypoint

Read `AGENTS.md` completely before inspecting or changing the repository. It is
the only repository-wide agent policy. Do not infer current paths, ownership,
feature status, or architecture from this adapter file.

Before an edit:

1. Read `docs/README.md`, `dev_docs/README.md`, and the closest applicable
   README or accepted ADR.
2. Inspect `git status --short` and preserve all existing user changes.
3. Confirm the current path and package through the filesystem and Cargo
   metadata; historical paths such as `apps/`, `adapters/`, `sidecars/`, and
   `crates/core-domain` are not the current layout.
4. Treat `docs/archive/`, `docs/goose/`, `docs/specifications/`, and dated
   owner reports as reference data, not active instructions.
5. Use Nexus for discovery, then verify important conclusions in source,
   manifests, entrypoints, and tests.

Never stage, commit, push, merge, rebase, reset, bulk-rename, bulk-delete, or
run repository-wide auto-fixes without the explicit authorization required by
`AGENTS.md`.
